[{'caption': 'One of the Signs of Fascism is "Using Fear to Gain Power." 

The MAGA/Republic Party has been perfecting that tactic, and it's front and center leading up to the midterms: fear (and hatred) of immigrants; fear (and hatred) of Muslims; fear (and hatred) of trans people; even fear (and hatred) of vegans. 🤦‍♀️ 

One example: Speaking next to the mad king at a rally in Michigan was the David Beamer. He is the father of Todd Beamer, a passenger on Flight 93 that crashed on 9/11 in Shanksville, PA, after he and others fought with the hijackers. David Beamer said: "[GOP candidate] Mike Rogers is an American. [Democrat] Abdul [el-Sayed] has a birth certificate. The birth certificate says he's a citizen of America. You know what? A birth certificate doesn't make you an American."

In fact, having a birth certificate DOES make you an American. 

But to the MAGA/GOP party, only certain people are 'true' Americans. 
The mad king echoed Beamer: “If Abdul and the Democrats win, they will create a nightmare of terror until you cannot even have a Christmas." 

RFK JR, the carcass-eating, cocaine-off-a-toilet-snorting head of HHS, claimed that  Arabs "don’t produce science, they don’t win the ⁠Nobel prize, they don’t win the Fields prize, they don’t win the Wolf prize, they don’t produce literature." All of which is verifiably false. 

Just a few days until the midterms, when we have a chance to elect people who can check the mad king and his henchmen at 𝙚𝙫𝙚𝙧𝙮 level of government. 

To join our weekly vigil, email boldactionworks@gmail.com

Thanks to our marshals from @indivisiblelancastertogether 👏

