The mad king has become $2.2 billion wealthier since taking office a second time, mostly from his crypto ventures.
This month, the Washington Post disclosed that he had raised $330 million from secret donors for the White House ballroom. About half of those companies have received government contracts in return. A trading company co-founded by PA's richest man Jeff Yass gave $5 million. Nvidia gave $25 million shortly after it reached a deal with the regime to sell its microchips to China. 

Corruption is also a family affair. The mad king's sons have joined boards of companies that then, surprise!, received lucrative government contracts. 

And this week, Vanity Fair excerpted a book revealing that Jared Kushner, the mad king's son-in-law and "envoy," has $2 billion in secret bank accounts filled by the Saudis and Emiratis. 

Fascist leaders enrich themselves while impoverishing the nation. We'll keep pointing out these signs of fascism.

Thanks to our fab marshals from @indivisiblelancastertogether 

To join our weekly vigils, email boldactionworks@gmail.com 

